# Operational type catalogue — GENERATED by entity_seed.py
#
# One stable scaffold: IRI per individuated particular TYPE in the alarm-
# type catalogue.  Each carries only base knowledge (rdf:type + label).
#
# NOT a store of usable particulars — op_knowledge.py mints owner-scoped
# entity: IRIs at grounding time (see sensor_iri/signal_iri) and consults
# this catalogue only to validate a concept and read its label.  See the
# module docstring in entity_seed.py for why scaffold: and entity: are
# kept as separate namespaces.
#
# Regenerated from scratch on every run — do not hand-edit; author
# real-world facts in a separate file or downstream of minting.

